{
  "_comment": [
    "Hand-curated seed catalog. The comprehensive WZDx set is discovered at",
    "runtime (`freetraffic sources discover-wzdx`). Merged from live-probe results",
    "and doc research (2026-06-30). Key facts: (1) the IBI/Travel-IQ platform has",
    "two API generations -- some installs answer /api/GetEvents, others",
    "/api/v2/get/event (epoch-seconds); the parser is tolerant of both. URLs marked",
    "'live-verified' returned 'Invalid Key' without a key (endpoint exists);",
    "'research-derived' URLs still need a live check. (2) There is NO GetTrafficSpeeds",
    "endpoint -- measured speeds come from a few installs' /api/v2/get/traveltimes",
    "plus WSDOT/CHART/etc. (3) Generic ArcGIS + Socrata feeds are keyless. Feeds",
    "needing a key stay enabled but no-op until the *_KEY env var is set."
  ],
